-2.  **Compute Ray Direction Norm:** Calculate the Euclidean norm of the normalized direction vector $(\tilde{x}, \tilde{y}, 1)$.
-    $$
-    \|\mathbf{v}\| = \sqrt{\tilde{x}^2 + \tilde{y}^2 + 1}
-    $$
