+   $$ \|\mathbf{v}\| = \sqrt{\tilde{x}^2 + \tilde{y}^2 + 1} $$
 
-3.  **Calculate Camera-Space Depth:** Divide the ray distance $d$ by the norm of the direction vector to project the distance onto the camera's Z-axis.
